  "post_title": "La Unión Musical de Onda celebra el Día Internacional de la Danza",
  "post_date": "2013-04-29 20:01:07",
  "post_name": "la-union-musical-de-onda-celebra-el-dia-internacional-de-la-danza",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Sin categoría",
  "post_content": "<p>La Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda ha celebrado la tarde de este lunes, desde poco antes de las 18 horas, en La Cassola, el D&iacute;a Internacional de la Danza, con la lectura de un manifiesto, dos actuaciones de las alumnas de danza Funky y la proyecci&oacute;n de varias videodanzas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/04/IMG_6672.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La lectura del manifiesto ha corrido a cargo de una de las profesoras y, despu&eacute;s, otra ha explicado en qu&eacute; consiste la videodanza. Se han proyectado videos de las tres escpecialidades que se imparten en el Centro de Danza de Onda: cl&aacute;sica, contempor&aacute;nea y espa&ntilde;ola.</p>\n<p>El acto ha finalizado con la proyecci&oacute;n de una videodanza en la que aparecen todas las chicas y los pocos chicos que cursan sus estudios en el Centro de Danza de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6662.jpg\" alt=\"img_6662\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6663.jpg\" alt=\"img_6663\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6664.jpg\" alt=\"img_6664\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6666.jpg\" alt=\"img_6666\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6667.jpg\" alt=\"img_6667\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6668.jpg\" alt=\"img_6668\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6669.jpg\" alt=\"img_6669\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6670.jpg\" alt=\"img_6670\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6672.jpg\" alt=\"img_6672\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6673.jpg\" alt=\"img_6673\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6674.jpg\" alt=\"img_6674\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6675.jpg\" alt=\"img_6675\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6676.jpg\" alt=\"img_6676\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6678.jpg\" alt=\"img_6678\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6679.jpg\" alt=\"img_6679\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6680.jpg\" alt=\"img_6680\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6681.jpg\" alt=\"img_6681\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6682.jpg\" alt=\"img_6682\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6683.jpg\" alt=\"img_6683\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6684.jpg\" alt=\"img_6684\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6685.jpg\" alt=\"img_6685\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6686.jpg\" alt=\"img_6686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6687.jpg\" alt=\"img_6687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6688.jpg\" alt=\"img_6688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6689.jpg\" alt=\"img_6689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6690.jpg\" alt=\"img_6690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6691.jpg\" alt=\"img_6691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diainternacionaldansa13/img_6692.jpg\" alt=\"img_6692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
